.TH "WISWA-MCP" "1" "May 22, 2026" "0.0.0" "wiswa-mcp"
.SH NAME
wiswa-mcp \- wiswa-mcp v0.0.0
.sp
FastMCP server exposing \X'tty: link https://github.com/Tatsh/wiswa'\fI\%Wiswa\fP\X'tty: link' settings discovery to AI
assistants such as Claude Code, Cursor, and GitHub Copilot.
.SH INSTALLATION
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
pipx install wiswa\-mcp
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SH USAGE
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
wiswa\-mcp
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
The server publishes the following MCP tools:
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
\fBget_defaults\fP — return resolved default settings, optionally narrowed to a dot\-separated key
path.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBlookup_setting\fP — return a single setting\(aqs default value plus a ready\-to\-paste
\fB\&.wiswa.jsonnet\fP override snippet.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBlist_settings\fP — enumerate the keys available at a given path and depth.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBsearch_settings\fP — substring search across fully\-qualified setting key paths.
.UNINDENT
.SS Claude Code
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
claude mcp add wiswa\-mcp \-\- wiswa\-mcp
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SS Cursor
.sp
Add to \fB\&.cursor/mcp.json\fP:
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
{
  \(dqmcpServers\(dq: {
    \(dqwiswa\-mcp\(dq: {
      \(dqcommand\(dq: \(dqwiswa\-mcp\(dq
    }
  }
}
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SS GitHub Copilot CLI
.sp
Add to \fB\&.github/copilot/mcp.json\fP:
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
{
  \(dqmcpServers\(dq: {
    \(dqwiswa\-mcp\(dq: {
      \(dqcommand\(dq: \(dqwiswa\-mcp\(dq
    }
  }
}
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
